SUMMARY:Swann Park Improvement Project Open House
LOCATION:Kate Jackson Community Center 821 South Rome Avenue Tampa \, FL 3
 3606 United States
DESCRIPTION:See whats next for Swann Park! The Citys Parks and Recreation 
 team invites neighbors and park patrons to stop by the Swann Park Design O
 pen House to explore the updated park design and learn about the projects 
 next steps based on feedback from hundreds of community members. Attendees
  can view the design at their own pace\, learn how community priorities in
 formed its development and talk directly with the project team. Thursday\,
  August 27 from 6 p.m. to 7 p.m. Kate Jackson Community Center\, 821 South
  Rome Avenue There is no formal presentation\, so stop by anytime during t
 he open house. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/193531
