SUMMARY:Figure Drawing Study
LOCATION:8132748130 Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Select Tuesdays  6:009:00 PM Classes Available  922\, 1020\, 1
 117\, 1215 Ages 18  Beginner Level Work in your drawing and painting media
  of choice or explore new ones. In these three-hour instructor-guided sing
 le-session classes\, students will learn the fundamentals and expand their
  2D knowledge while creating images from life. Learn the basics and grow y
 our techniques with tailored instruction and live model sessions. Drawing 
 materials provided. These classes do have live Nude Models. \n\nPermalink:
  https://www.tampa.gov/node/193661
