SUMMARY:Remix: David Hockney Holiday Cards
LOCATION:120 W Gasparilla Plaza Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, Dec 3  6:009:00 PM Ages 18  Beginner Level Remix is
  a series of make-and-take art workshops for adults inspired by the Museum
 s current exhibitions with a new project every month. This months project 
 will be inspired by our upcoming David Hockney: Perspectives Should Be Rev
 ersed Exhibition (https:tampamuseum.orgupcoming-exhibitions)\, focusing on
  creating charming greeting cards for the holiday season or any occasion! 
 Workshops are designed to be enjoyed by participants of any skill level\, 
 and all materials are provided. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/
 193681
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193681
